S115: Bonferroni-3 needs a missing-depth guard
==============================================================================
Pointwise formula:
  T_r(x)=(-1)^(r+d) C_{d,r}(x), d=# base-missed inner sectors.
  C_{d,r} counts r-subsets of far runners whose colors cover the
  missing sectors and use no already-covered/zero sector colors.

